    "note": [
     {
      "text": "52-year-old female presenting with excessive thirst and frequent urination for 4 months. Character: passing urine many times, also at night; radiation: n/a; aggravated by sweet food; relieved by nothing. Severity 6/10. Associated: blurred vision, weight loss. PMH: Type 2 diabetes for 6 years. Drugs: Metformin 500 mg. Allergy: no known allergies. Family: diabetes. Personal: smokes bidi daily. Triage: ROUTINE."
